Summary: some remarks about dragon scale mail
Keywords: wishes,armor

in many articles about first wishes people like to mention 'gray
dragon scale mail' because it will give magic resistance and a good
armor class. IMNSHO this misses the point completely. this seems to
come from the old version of NH where in fact magic resistance was
hard to get. in 3.1 five of the quest items will give mag. res., every
neutral character can wish for the tourist item (which gives mag. res.
along w/ESP, so you don't have to worry about killing priests and it
works like a blessed scroll of charging for an infinite number of
times) and it's no big deal to make GDSM in case you should still need
it in an advanced state of your game. in the beginning you get killed
more often for not having poison or sleep res. (esp. now that monsters
can zap wands of sleep) than for lack of mag. res., so it's even more
reasonable to go for green or orange DSM if granted an early wish.
this is even ok againt polymorph traps because wearing DSM will then
make you to become a dragon of the respective color and you will not
break out of your armor (your cloak will be torn off though). still
I'd rather wish for speed boots which have become the most important
piece of armor in the new version of the game. they won't show such an
impressive number for your AC but being fast will effectively give a
better protection and might even allow you to run from monsters that
would kill you wearing your DSM. (unfortunately no chromatic DSM seems
to exist which could have been the best armor at all.)

